<title>SWEDEN: German Bankgesellschaft Berlin to Stockholm bourse.</title>
<headline>German Bankgesellschaft Berlin to Stockholm bourse.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's banking group Bankgesellschaft Berlin AG will be admitted as a new member on the Stockholm Stock Exchange on Monday, the exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The bank will be able to take part in trading from offices in Berlin as of Monday, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank will become the 12th remote member on the Stockholm Stock Exchange, a spokesman at the exchange said. Such members are connected to the bourse electronically without having a local office.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
